<title>USA: Federal Reserve business loans fell in Oct 30 week.</title>
<headline>Federal Reserve business loans fell in Oct 30 week.</headline>
<text>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED OCTOBER 30</p>
<p>(Seasonally adjusted, millions of dollars)</p>
<p> Business loans............766,600 down...1,300</p>
<p> Govt, agency securities...697,200 up.....6,100</p>
<p> Large time deposits.......473,600 down.....400</p>
<p> U.S. commercial paper.....758,905 up.....3.262</p>
<p> Financial companies.......574,079 up.....6,966</p>
<p> New York business loans....43,079 up.......654</p>
<p> Excluding acceptances......42,829 up.......654</p>
</text>
